(Sheldon:)Once a quarter, keep our readiness up.

4
00:00:23,189 --> 00:00:27,439
(Sheldon:)Now, rise and shine, sleepy head.
HaIf the town is probably dead.

5
00:00:28,278 --> 00:00:31,408
