(Sheldon:)Each of these cards contains a detailed
scenario of a possible apocalyptic event.

8
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:44,963
Everything from wildfires
to a surprise invasion by Canada.

9
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:48,841
(Sheldon:)Pick a catastrophe, any catastrophe.

10
00:00:49,466 --> 00:00:54,136
(Leonard:)Sheldon, Canada is not
going to invade California.

11
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:58,144
(Sheldon:)Yeah, really? You think those hippies
in washington and Oregon can stop them?

12
00:00:59,142 --> 00:01:01,222
Oh. Fine.

